{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hollow Mine</strong> is an action <strong>rogue-lite</strong> that combines mining, crafting, and intense 2D top-down combat. Looking for your next addiction? Try this extremely satisfying experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight enemies in your own style using melee combat, range weapons or magic spells!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a variety of weapons. Improve them using mined resources and crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/3d339bdc56cdfc5da97f250c70788b10.poster.avif?t=1757267058\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/3d339bdc56cdfc5da97f250c70788b10.webm?t=1757267058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/3d339bdc56cdfc5da97f250c70788b10.mp4?t=1757267058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine resources, destroy walls and dig tunnels to flank enemies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience procedurally generated rooms with a <strong>fully destructible environment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/cd897dcb813034135d34e9c90383e7d6.poster.avif?t=1757267058\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/cd897dcb813034135d34e9c90383e7d6.webm?t=1757267058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/cd897dcb813034135d34e9c90383e7d6.mp4?t=1757267058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft and repair powerful weapons!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>over 100 unique weapons and spells</strong>, each upgradable through crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find blueprints, gather herbs, dig ores, and loot treasures to create potions, weapons, and spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/6a36398bd3f84e2c5c111d9b70b62303.avif?t=1757267058\" width=630 height=354 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up and unlock powerful abilities!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>more than 100 unique abilities</strong> that improve and transform your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/c1541b71022a97cee893ec3415095c05.avif?t=1757267058\" width=630 height=354 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight bosses at the end of each biome!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong>over 20 unique boss fights</strong>, including a challenging final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/b2b8d7352078efc97e6d787c8f794ed0.poster.avif?t=1757267058\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/b2b8d7352078efc97e6d787c8f794ed0.webm?t=1757267058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/b2b8d7352078efc97e6d787c8f794ed0.mp4?t=1757267058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demolish your foes with mining wagons, bombs and other deadly traps.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse biomes, their unique environments, and countless ways to defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/835cec862581262d7945526181cb5e85.poster.avif?t=1757267058\" width=630 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/835cec862581262d7945526181cb5e85.webm?t=1757267058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/835cec862581262d7945526181cb5e85.mp4?t=1757267058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock and pick from multiple characters classes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and play <strong>more than 20 different character classes</strong>. Each with its unique ability and starting equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/80a8e8d9569471fc610128790b178633.avif?t=1757267058\" width=630 height=354 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique biomes with 90+ procedurally generated rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ bosses and over 250 items to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ upgradeable weapons &amp; spells plus 100+ unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ unlockable classes with distinct play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic environments - mine walls, set traps, and reshape the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blueprint crafting system for weapons, potions and magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced roguelike runs packed with secrets, lore, and NPC interactions.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2465060?t=1757267058","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2465060?t=1757267058","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/fcf86461dc1cc44460058a0c13cf996492cc5a1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757267058","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/fcf86461dc1cc44460058a0c13cf996492cc5a1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757267058","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hollow Mine</strong> is an action <strong>rogue-lite</strong> that combines mining, crafting, and intense 2D top-down combat. Looking for your next addiction? Try this extremely satisfying experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight enemies in your own style using melee combat, range weapons or magic spells!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a variety of weapons. Improve them using mined resources and crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/3d339bdc56cdfc5da97f250c70788b10.poster.avif?t=1757267058\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/3d339bdc56cdfc5da97f250c70788b10.webm?t=1757267058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/3d339bdc56cdfc5da97f250c70788b10.mp4?t=1757267058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine resources, destroy walls and dig tunnels to flank enemies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience procedurally generated rooms with a <strong>fully destructible environment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/cd897dcb813034135d34e9c90383e7d6.poster.avif?t=1757267058\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/cd897dcb813034135d34e9c90383e7d6.webm?t=1757267058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/cd897dcb813034135d34e9c90383e7d6.mp4?t=1757267058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft and repair powerful weapons!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>over 100 unique weapons and spells</strong>, each upgradable through crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find blueprints, gather herbs, dig ores, and loot treasures to create potions, weapons, and spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/6a36398bd3f84e2c5c111d9b70b62303.avif?t=1757267058\" width=630 height=354 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up and unlock powerful abilities!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>more than 100 unique abilities</strong> that improve and transform your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/c1541b71022a97cee893ec3415095c05.avif?t=1757267058\" width=630 height=354 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight bosses at the end of each biome!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong>over 20 unique boss fights</strong>, including a challenging final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/b2b8d7352078efc97e6d787c8f794ed0.poster.avif?t=1757267058\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/b2b8d7352078efc97e6d787c8f794ed0.webm?t=1757267058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/b2b8d7352078efc97e6d787c8f794ed0.mp4?t=1757267058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demolish your foes with mining wagons, bombs and other deadly traps.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse biomes, their unique environments, and countless ways to defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/835cec862581262d7945526181cb5e85.poster.avif?t=1757267058\" width=630 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/835cec862581262d7945526181cb5e85.webm?t=1757267058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/835cec862581262d7945526181cb5e85.mp4?t=1757267058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock and pick from multiple characters classes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and play <strong>more than 20 different character classes</strong>. Each with its unique ability and starting equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/80a8e8d9569471fc610128790b178633.avif?t=1757267058\" width=630 height=354 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique biomes with 90+ procedurally generated rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ bosses and over 250 items to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ upgradeable weapons &amp; spells plus 100+ unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ unlockable classes with distinct play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic environments - mine walls, set traps, and reshape the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blueprint crafting system for weapons, potions and magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced roguelike runs packed with secrets, lore, and NPC interactions.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Micha\u0142 Parysz"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/header.jpg?t=1757267058","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101182,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101182/movie480.mp4?t=1740265211","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101182/movie_max.mp4?t=1740265211"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101182/320b5c25b84f3113ee49b045b855dbd6f395fb64/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740265211","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101182/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740265211","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101182/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=